{"id":"krome","lemma":"кроме","pos":"prep","rank":253,"glosses":["except, besides"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/49/Ru-%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Все знают, кроме тебя.","en":"Everyone knows except you.","words":[{"g":"everyone, everybody"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},null,{"g":"you","l":"ты"}]},{"text":"Все пришли, кроме вас.","en":"Everyone had come except you.","words":[{"g":"everyone, everybody"},{"g":"to come , to arrive","l":"прийти"},null,{"g":"you","l":"вы"}]},{"text":"Я ненавижу всех, кроме тебя.","en":"I hate everyone except you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hate","l":"ненавидеть"},{"g":"all","l":"весь"},null,{"g":"you","l":"ты"}]},{"text":"У него нет друзей, кроме меня.","en":"He has no friends besides me.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"he, it","l":"он"},{"g":"no / there isn't"},{"g":"close friend","l":"друг"},null,{"g":"me","l":"я"}]},{"text":"Кроме меня, там никого не было.","en":"There was no one there besides me.","words":[null,{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"there"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"}]}]}